1. The position vectors of points P and Q are $\begin{pmatrix}2\\-3\\1\end{pmatrix}$ and $\begin{pmatrix}2\\2\\-4\end{pmatrix}$ respectively. The origin is at O. Find
(a) the angle $\hat{POQ}$;
(b) the area of the triangle OPQ.

